# Designed Database of MR Brain Images of Healthy Volunteers - auxiliary data

Auxiliary data distributed with the database ("AuxillaryData" folders):

* `sub-<id>/anat/sub-<id>_acq-flash_desc-brain_T1w.nii.gz`: skull-stripped
  T1 (FLASH) image.
* `sub-<id>/anat/sub-<id>_desc-vessels_tubes.tre`: vascular network
  extracted from the MRA, in TubeTK's `.tre` (SpatialObject) format,
  copied as is.
